Package: uv
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: python3
Description: extremely fast Python package and project manager
 uv is an extremely fast Python package and project manager, written in
 Rust. It replaces pip, pip-tools, pipx, poetry, pyenv, twine and
 virtualenv with a single binary, running 10-100x faster than the tools
 it stands in for.
 .
 Provides project management with a universal lockfile, a pip-compatible
 interface, script execution with inline dependency metadata, tool
 installation and one-shot tool runs via uvx, and managed Python
 interpreter installs.
 .
 This package ships both the uv and uvx binaries plus shell completions
 for bash, zsh and fish. python3 is recommended so that uv resolves the
 system interpreter instead of downloading a managed one.
